<title>USA: American Intl Q4 Dec 31 full results.</title>
<headline>American Intl Q4 Dec 31 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>				     1996		   1995</p>
<p> Revenues		 $ 4,111,000	   $ 2,811,000</p>
<p> Expenses		8,763,000(a)	     7,149,000</p>
<p> Net loss		 (4,652,000)(a	$(4,338,000)</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 ( 0.16)		 ( 0.20)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>   shares outstanding  29,598,832	    21,746,719</p>
<p>Note: (a) Includes non-cash charges of $4,185,000 or $.16 per share.</p>
<p>				  Twelve Months Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					     1996		   1995</p>
<p> Net production (barrels)	  130,433		155,615</p>
<p> Realized price per barrel	  $10.46		  $8.16</p>
<p> Production cost per barrel	   4.69		   2.78</p>
<p>Proved equivalent oil</p>
<p>  reserves (bbls.)	    6,457,000(a)	    6,003,000</p>
<p>Future net revenues</p>
<p>  discounted at 10%	  21,902,000(a)	   12,359,000</p>
<p>Note: (a) The company sold all of its oil and gas reserves in February 1997 for a purchase price of up to $20.2 million.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is American International Petroleum Corp.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
